# Scratch queue rows CC (plan_process_overhaul.md P2.1). Data: the queue table in scratch_queue.md is generated
# from this file (python3 tools/status_index.py). Format: tools/scratch_query/qrows.py docstring.
# Run: qrun.py run OUT feature_writeup/testing/rows/CC.qb RES [--section KEY] [--rows ID,...]

@@section 1
@@title SQ-CC Creative Common 1.1.0 full check: the 11-07 18:02 build and every Common feature since the split, 2026-11-07 ([creative_split.md](../creative_split.md) 7.19, [creative_engineering.md](../creative_engineering.md) 7.1 and 7.2, [loading_tips.md](../loading_tips.md), [effects.md](../effects.md))
@@date 2026-11-07
@@jars creativecommon creativeengineering
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_split.md feature_writeup/creative_engineering.md feature_writeup/loading_tips.md feature_writeup/effects.md
@@text
@@text Not run. Targets `development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-1.1.0.jar` built 2026-11-07 18:02 (`mods/` still holds
@@text the 16:44 build; prep_srv.sh swaps the newer one into a scratch server, copy it into `mods/` only with the game closed).
@@text This section is the Common-only regression; it points at older rows for the cross-jar checks instead of repeating them.
@@text Changed in the 18:02 build: `SequencedAssemblyRecipeMixin`, `CreateTeaPipeIconMixin`, `FluidTagInputMixin`,
@@text `DrinkFluidEffects` left for Engineering and `FruitsDelightEffectFuncMixin` for Delight (SQ-CPP); `MOD_RANGE` rows for
@@text create, immersiveengineering and fruitsdelight dropped; `mods.toml` ordering rows now Immersive Portals and Heartstone;
@@text config defaults `[mod_names] overrides` and `[effects] removed` empty; the Creative Tips pack left the jar for
@@text `kubejs/assets/creative_tips/loading_tips/tips.json`; `create:scrap_*` placeholder tags gone; tags `creativecommon:bark`
@@text and `metal_dusts`; dict keys for Create Framed / SecurityCraft tinted glass and the mirror glass block tags. Probe:
@@text `tools/scratch_query/cc_dict_probe.js`. Rows marked (old) rerun an earlier row on this build.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-CC-01
@group build check (no boot)
@commands `unzip -l development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-1.1.0.jar \| grep -E "DrinkFluidEffects\|FluidTagInputMixin\|SequencedAssemblyRecipeMixin\|CreateTeaPipeIconMixin\|FruitsDelightEffectFuncMixin\|resourcepacks/creative_tips\|data/create/tags"`; `unzip -p <jar> creativecommon.mixins.json \| grep -c Mixin`; `unzip -p <jar> META-INF/mods.toml \| grep -E "modId\|version="`
@pass the first command prints nothing; every mixin named in the json has a class in the jar; `mods.toml` lists no `create`, `immersiveengineering`, `fruitsdelight` dependency and does list `immersive_portals` and `heartstone` (optional, `ordering="NONE"`: the Heartstone-before-IP order is set in `CommonMixinPlugin`)
@fails a moved file left behind (git status shows it staged as deleted), a json entry for a class that moved
@reviewed 2026-11-16
shell J=$(ls "$INST"/development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-*.jar | head -1); test -z "$(unzip -l "$J" | grep -E "DrinkFluidEffects|FluidTagInputMixin|SequencedAssemblyRecipeMixin|CreateTeaPipeIconMixin|FruitsDelightEffectFuncMixin|resourcepacks/creative_tips|data/create/tags")" && echo "no moved file in the jar"
shell J=$(ls "$INST"/development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-*.jar | head -1); python3 -c "import zipfile,json,sys; z=zipfile.ZipFile(sys.argv[1]); j=json.loads(z.read('creativecommon.mixins.json')); n=set(z.namelist()); p=j['package'].replace('.','/'); m=[c for k in ('mixins','client','server') for c in j.get(k,[]) if p+'/'+c.replace('.','/')+'.class' not in n]; print('mixins without a class:', m); sys.exit(1 if m else 0)" "$J"
shell J=$(ls "$INST"/development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-*.jar | head -1); unzip -p "$J" META-INF/mods.toml | grep -E "modId|ordering"; ! unzip -p "$J" META-INF/mods.toml | grep -qE 'modId *= *"(create|immersiveengineering|fruitsdelight)"'
shell J=$(ls "$INST"/development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-*.jar | head -1); unzip -p "$J" META-INF/mods.toml | grep -qE 'modId *= *"immersive_portals"' && unzip -p "$J" META-INF/mods.toml | grep -qE 'modId *= *"heartstone"' && echo "IP and Heartstone listed"
look the mods.toml lines: immersive_portals and heartstone optional with ordering="NONE"
## SQ-CC-02
@group A (full pack)
@commands boot; `grep -E "Mixin apply failed\|InvalidMixinException\|outside the tested range\|ClassNotFoundException\|NoClassDefFoundError" logs/latest.log`; `grep -n "creativecommon: .* files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log`; `grep -c "ERROR" logs/kubejs/startup.log`
@pass no mixin or class error; no out-of-range warning; all Common startup files loaded; 0 startup script errors (also reruns SQ-CMV-01 and SQ-CPP-01)
@fails `CommonMixinPlugin.MOD_RANGE` / `NEEDS_MOD` (a table row still naming a moved mixin), `creativecommon.mixins.json`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|outside the tested range
bootreject (?i)(ClassNotFoundException|NoClassDefFoundError).*(creativecommon|SaintAlfonzo)
shell grep -n "creativecommon: .* files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log | head -3
shell grep -qE "creativecommon: .* files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell test "$(grep -c "ERROR" logs/kubejs/startup.log)" = 0 && echo "0 startup errors"
